OL,3,GNEWSALittlewoods film studios plan
OL,4,Agiven #20m Budget boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has pledged #20m towards
OL,7,Fplans to transform Liverpool's derelict
OL,8,FLittlewoods building into a film and
OL,9,Ftelevision production campus.
OL,11,FThe funding, announced in the Budget
OL,12,Fearlier, will come from the
OL,13,Fgovernment's Growth Mission Fund but is
OL,14,Fsubject to final business case
OL,15,Fapproval.
OL,17,FThe long-delayed project would see the
OL,18,Fformer Littlewoods Pools headquarters
OL,19,Fon Edge Lane turned into a 260,000 sq
OL,20,Fft (six-acre, 2.4-hectare) creative
OL,21,Fcampus for film, television, gaming and
OL,22,Fother digital screen industries.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
