OL,3,GNEWSALittlewoods film studios plan
OL,4,Agiven #20m Budget boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is unclear whether the money will be
OL,7,Fenough to meet the project's funding
OL,8,Fneeds - Liverpool City Region Mayor
OL,9,FSteve Rotheram previously sought #50m
OL,10,Fin government support.
